          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Download.Pending.PendingReleaseService.FindPendingQueueItemObsolete(System.Int32)"
        ],
        "id": "R2",
        "text": "Pending releases are found by matching the id among the pending queue items."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
